      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"Pharmacy-AbouttheFeature\">About the Feature</h2><p>Pharmacy management enables a healthcare facility to effectively dispense medications to patients, monitor &amp; manage stock and suppliers and in billing and accounting for drugs and services.</p><h2 id=\"Pharmacy-UsedBy\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Used By</span></h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Pharmacy management is used primarily by the pharmacy section in a healthcare facility. However in certain scenarios, it can also be used by the healthcare provider such as in small health units in remote areas.</span></p><h2 id=\"Pharmacy-HowisitUsed?\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">How is it Used?</span></h2><h3 id=\"Pharmacy-CreateMedications/Drugs\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Create Medications / Drugs</span></h3><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Please refer to <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114727368/Configure+Medication+Data\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114727368\" data-linked-resource-version=\"8\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">this page</a> for further details on creating medications/drugs.</span></p><p><iframe class=\"youtube-player conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"0b7ab7f6-35d8-4a76-b536-c3af2a76d50a\" data-macro-name=\"widget\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/3bkVZyqZJoU?wmode=opaque\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 300px\" type=\"text/html\">\n</iframe>\n    \n</p><h3 id=\"Pharmacy-DeleteMedications/Drugs\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Delete Medications / Drugs</span></h3><p>Please refer to <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/display/BAH/Configure+Medication+Data#ConfigureMedicationData-DeleteMedication/DrugData\" rel=\"nofollow\">this page</a> for details on deleting medications / drugs</p><p><iframe class=\"youtube-player conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"6564c86e-c203-4b52-8487-f44f1266fbdc\" data-macro-name=\"widget\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/yRZ-e3z58Us?wmode=opaque\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 300px\" type=\"text/html\">\n</iframe>\n    \n</p><h3 id=\"Pharmacy-CheckStockLevels(Odoo)\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Check Stock Levels (Odoo)</span></h3><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"04775de4-c973-4026-9dbf-748904c661a4\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-blue3\">The following steps and screenshots are explained as per Odoo 10, available on Bahmni 0.92 release.</span></p></div></div><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">There are multiple ways you can see stock levels. Go to &quot;Menu / Warehouse&quot;</span></p><ul><li>From left menu, &quot;Reports / Inventory Valuation&quot; provides a view grouped by Products (only available ones) and stock locations. </li></ul><p style=\"margin-left: 30.0px;\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/Odoo_Inventory_Valuation_Products.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565774942977&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=928&amp;height=400\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014364/Odoo_Inventory_Valuation_Products.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565774942977&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"907968549\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Odoo_Inventory_Valuation_Products.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014364\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"17\" data-media-id=\"6a3961dd-6327-4b35-afea-9b30b4371492\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/Odoo_Inventory_Valuation_Products.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565774942977&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1856&amp;height=800 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/Odoo_Inventory_Valuation_Products.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565774942977&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=928&amp;height=400 1x\"></span></p><p><br/></p><ul><li>From left menu, &quot;Configuration / Warehouse / Location&quot;, provides list of all internal locations, and from a selected location, thereon, you can choose &quot;Products&quot; from the &quot;Action&quot; menu. You may remove/add additional filters to see all products (or only products having stock) for a location. </li></ul><p style=\"margin-left: 30.0px;\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/Odoo_Products_Inventory_by_location.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565775190807&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=752&amp;height=400\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014364/Odoo_Products_Inventory_by_location.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565775190807&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"907935778\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Odoo_Products_Inventory_by_location.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014364\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"17\" data-media-id=\"390b70ea-43a3-4d32-b8c7-f7b7f8525bc2\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/Odoo_Products_Inventory_by_location.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565775190807&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1504&amp;height=800 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/Odoo_Products_Inventory_by_location.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565775190807&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=752&amp;height=400 1x\"></span></p><p><br/></p><h3 id=\"Pharmacy-CheckMedicineStockLevels(OpenERP)\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Check Medicine Stock Levels (OpenERP)</span></h3><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"b9a0c152-3a5c-49fb-b1b4-80f5699d3369\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><p class=\"title\">Compatibility</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Note, this applies only for OpenERP7. Applicable for Bahmni 0.91 and earlier. </p></div></div><p><br/></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">There are many ways you can view stock levels in ERP.  For that, go to &quot;Menu / Warehouse&quot;. </span></p><ul><li>From left menu &quot;Inventory Control / Location Structure&quot;, you can select &quot;Physical Location&quot;, and then from the resulting tree view, you can click the &quot;Stock&quot;. Subsequently specify <span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span>“Analyze Current Inventory” for analysis type and you can view stock information across all locations. </span></span></li></ul><p style=\"margin-left: 30.0px;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/OpenERP_Location_Structure_Product_By_Location.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565774268112&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=807&amp;height=400\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014364/OpenERP_Location_Structure_Product_By_Location.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565774268112&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"908001295\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"OpenERP_Location_Structure_Product_By_Location.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014364\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"17\" data-media-id=\"4e653300-ea71-492a-9432-7fd2de0f85f7\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/OpenERP_Location_Structure_Product_By_Location.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565774268112&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1614&amp;height=800 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/OpenERP_Location_Structure_Product_By_Location.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565774268112&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=807&amp;height=400 1x\"></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span>        <span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/OpenERP_Location_Structure_Product_Inventory_Analysis.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565774345892&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=716&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014364/OpenERP_Location_Structure_Product_Inventory_Analysis.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565774345892&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"907935755\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"OpenERP_Location_Structure_Product_Inventory_Analysis.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014364\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"17\" data-media-id=\"bd15ef4e-f57c-4576-9bb0-3a2f890dee02\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/OpenERP_Location_Structure_Product_Inventory_Analysis.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565774345892&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1432&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/OpenERP_Location_Structure_Product_Inventory_Analysis.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565774345892&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=716&amp;height=250 1x\"></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><ul><li><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span>You can also see location-wise stock, by accessing from left menu &quot;Configuration / Locations&quot;, selecting a particular location (e.g. Pharmacy) and from the &quot;more&quot; menu options selecting &quot;Products by location&quot;, where you can choose analysis type (e.g. Analyze Current Inventory) to get stock levels at a location. </span></span></li></ul><p><br/></p><h3 id=\"Pharmacy-Stocktransfer\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Stock transfer</span></h3><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"434ebc76-8c88-4eff-95b7-01c2c48faa14\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-blue3\">The following steps and screenshots are explained as per Odoo 10, available on Bahmni 0.92 release.</span></p></div></div><p>If you would want to move stocks from one location to another (say from main stock to IPD Pharmacy), you need to do an stock transfer, and specifically internal transfer. </p><p>Go to &quot;Menu / Inventory &quot;, and from the dashboard, select &quot;Internal Transfer&quot;. </p><p>(alternatively, from left menu &quot;Operations / Transfers&quot;, you can initiate a stock transfer as well, but you need to specify the &quot;picking type&quot; to &quot;Internal Transfer&quot; in the &quot;Additional Info' tab) </p><p>Subsequently, you can specify the source (e.g. Main Stock) and destination (e.g IPD Pharmacy), and proceed with creation of stock transfer request, which will lead towards validation and confirmation. </p><p style=\"margin-left: 30.0px;\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/Odoo_Internal_Stock_Transfer_Acyclovir.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565778635222&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=957&amp;height=400\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014364/Odoo_Internal_Stock_Transfer_Acyclovir.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565778635222&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"908001322\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Odoo_Internal_Stock_Transfer_Acyclovir.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014364\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"17\" data-media-id=\"4ded822c-2f90-4c67-a6ac-68d626e67e14\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/Odoo_Internal_Stock_Transfer_Acyclovir.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565778635222&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1914&amp;height=800 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/Odoo_Internal_Stock_Transfer_Acyclovir.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565778635222&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=957&amp;height=400 1x\"></span></p><h3 id=\"Pharmacy-AddDiscounts\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Add Discounts</span></h3><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Please refer to <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/display/BAH/Manage+Orders\" rel=\"nofollow\">this page</a> for further details on adding discounts, paying in installments, etc.</span></p><h3 id=\"Pharmacy-AddTaxesandVATonMRP\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Add Taxes and VAT on MRP</span></h3><p>Some suppliers apply VAT and other taxes on the MRP instead of the unit price. Please refer to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://doc.odoo.com/book/3/3_9/tax_structure/\" rel=\"nofollow\">this documentation</a> about adding taxes and VAT on MRP.</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"ef642bf1-eadd-4832-8625-9614dd85d980\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>In OpenMRP:</p><ul><li>The MRP is maintained for each product at a supplier level.</li><li>The MRP is entered while making a quotation.</li><li>If the tax is to be applied on the MRP, the bill calculation is done accordingly.</li><li>If the MRP is changed in a quotation, it gets updated at the supplier level too.</li></ul></div></div><h3 class=\"auto-cursor-target\" id=\"Pharmacy-UsingtheBilling/PharmacyApp\">Using the Billing/Pharmacy App</h3><p>If the <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115777052/Billing+Pharmacy+App\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115777052\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Billing/Pharmacy App</a> has been enabled in your Bahmni instance, it will appear as an icon on your Home page. In this instance, it is named as &quot;<em>Prescription</em>&quot;</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/image2017-3-30_11-49-24.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1490854766210&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=192\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014364/image2017-3-30_11-49-24.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1490854766210&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115807568\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-3-30_11-49-24.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014364\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"17\" data-media-id=\"b12922b3-898f-42ef-9508-f9c31884c2e3\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/image2017-3-30_11-49-24.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1490854766210&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=552&amp;height=266 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/image2017-3-30_11-49-24.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1490854766210&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=192 1x\"></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">On clicking on the “Prescription” widget on the home screen, you will see the patient search queue.</span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/image2017-3-30_11-50-21.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1490858507632&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=194\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014364/image2017-3-30_11-50-21.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1490858507632&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115808791\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-3-30_11-50-21.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014364\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"17\" data-media-id=\"767d6528-1fc4-4e31-82d4-e292abca0771\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/image2017-3-30_11-50-21.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1490858507632&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=624&amp;height=304 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/image2017-3-30_11-50-21.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1490858507632&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=194 1x\"></span></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Selecting a patient from the queue enables us to view the Patient’s prescription or to directly Order/Refill/Dispense medications. </span></span><br/></span></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/image2017-3-30_12-47-33.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1490858259055&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=345\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014364/image2017-3-30_12-47-33.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1490858259055&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115808578\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-3-30_12-47-33.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014364\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"17\" data-media-id=\"480b4773-aad2-4253-984e-2e608f172109\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/image2017-3-30_12-47-33.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1490858259055&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1198&amp;height=592 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014364/image2017-3-30_12-47-33.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1490858259055&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=345 1x\"></span></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e4e357ee-8b8f-40f4-8c33-40938be496b2\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"fd8d9b86-f45a-4a8a-a195-cab36abf2fb5\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div> <p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014364/Pharmacy\">Pharmacy - Feature Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"3fe3feef-06ea-4aac-b9a1-a6bbe83b0bec\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Implemnentation Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014590/Pharmacy+Configuration\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32014590\" data-linked-resource-version=\"19\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Pharmacy - Implementer's Guide</a> (OpenERP7)</span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/900530225/Odoo+Inventory+Configuration\" data-linked-resource-id=\"900530225\" data-linked-resource-version=\"12\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Inventory Configuration</a> (Odoo)</span></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
